          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuandikirani mambo higa kuhusu atu ambao analonda kukuchengani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Jesu watiya Roho Mtakatifu mwenu mioyoni. Kpwa vira Rohowe a mwenu mioyoni, phahi tamuna haja ya kufundzwa ni mutu. Mana iye Rohowe anakufundzani chila chitu, na higo ambago anakufundzani ni ga kpweli, wala si handzo. Phahi, lungani mafundzoge, na muenderere kukala phamwenga naye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
